  "description_short": "Wine bar and café in the historic Prince Vintcent Building serving coffee, cocktails, and light meals with live music.",
  "description_long": "Tucked inside the historic Prince Vintcent Building in the heart of Mossel Bay, The Vintcent (also known as Cafe Vintcent) brings together the best of café culture and wine bar elegance. Whether you're settling in for morning coffee and pastries or returning for sundowners and cocktails, the atmosphere shifts seamlessly from casual to celebratory.\n\nThe menu covers all bases — breakfast spreads, light lunches, sharing platters, and a carefully curated wine list that celebrates local producers. Live music events and their function-friendly setup make it a popular spot for both locals catching up and visitors exploring the town centre.\n\nWith its central location and versatile vibe, The Vintcent works equally well as a quick coffee stop, a leisurely lunch venue, or an evening out with friends. The historic building adds character, and the welcoming service keeps people coming back.",
